diff --git a/forth/file-sysc2.4 b/forth/file-sysc2.4
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..84fd023
--- /dev/null
+++ b/forth/file-sysc2.4
@@ -0,0 +1,17 @@
+\ file-sysc2.4 - with file-sysc.4, the rest of the file words over SYSCALL:
+\ OPEN-FILE, CLOSE-FILE, WRITE-FILE (Iteration 205, fsys 2 - the single-
+\ SYSCALL family, results/drafts/fsys/single-syscall.md). The kernel compiled
+\ INCLUDED and SAVE-SYSTEM against the primitives; in a design with fsys 2 the
+\ converter rebinds those uses to these words (tools/layout.py --rebind), so no
+\ handler is left referred to. The results the handlers gave: OPEN-FILE the
+\ descriptor and 200 on failure, CLOSE-FILE close's result, WRITE-FILE -200.
+CREATE FS-OFL 577 , 577 , 0 , 0 , 2 , 2 , 1089 , 1089 , 578 , 578 ,   \ open(2)'s flags by fam - the engine's open_flags
+VARIABLE FS-END  VARIABLE FS-SAVED
+: OPEN-FILE ( c-addr u fam --- fid ior )        \ open(2), mode 0644, the name ended by a 0 a moment
+  CELLS FS-OFL + @ >R
+  OVER + DUP FS-END ! C@ FS-SAVED !  0 FS-END @ C!
+  R> 420 2 FS3
+  FS-SAVED @ FS-END @ C!
+  DUP 0< IF 200 ELSE 0 THEN ;
+: CLOSE-FILE ( fid --- ior )  FS-DROP 3 FS1 ;   \ its read-ahead dropped, then close(2)
+: WRITE-FILE ( c-addr u fid --- ior )  FS-DROP FS-WRITE IF 0 ELSE -200 THEN ;
diff --git a/lab/evolve/README.md b/lab/evolve/README.md
index 5d3d9ec..7841953 100644
--- a/lab/evolve/README.md
+++ b/lab/evolve/README.md
@@ -487,3 +487,16 @@ so nothing else changes. Counted on the smallest (kernel, corpus, parse):
 16 chains +17%, +49%, +53% dispatches for 128 bytes less; 64 chains -9%, -28%,
 -27% for ~240 bytes more; 128 chains -14%, -41%, -43% for ~700. The standard
 suite whole at 16, 64 and 128; at 32 every image byte for byte as before.
+
+## fsys 2 (Iteration 205): the single-SYSCALL family, stage A
+
+fsys now takes 0 (every I/O primitive native), 1 (six file words and RESIZE
+in Forth) and 2: OPEN-FILE, CLOSE-FILE, WRITE-FILE, ALLOCATE and FREE too
+(forth/file-sysc2.4, loaded after file-sysc.4 in an -fsys2 dump). The kernel
+compiled INCLUDED and SAVE-SYSTEM against those primitives, so the converter
+rebinds every compiled use to the Forth word (--rebind: ('P', name) becomes a
+call), and the engine (FSYS=2) drops their five handlers - the C runtime's
+allocator with them. Measured: the smallest 628 bytes smaller in all, the knee
+644, the fastest 1,039; every design through the full gate (the kernel
+workload opens its files through the Forth words); the standard suite 14 of 14
+as s6. Stage B: WRITE with its buffer on the heap, READ, READ-LINE, BYE.
